==Battleground==
*3 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Golem Sunfish]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Oldhorn]]s spawn, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
You can stack piercing attackers on the starting UltraBaaBaas using [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] to pick off 2 of them, and then stalling the third to overrun the enemies as soon as they spawn. Specifically, stacking [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cats]] can help you finish the stage by killing Golem Sunfish and Elizabeth at the enemy base. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] is the second most potent of your sniper options, with his great health and damage, especially against the Relics in this stage. Bring some meatshields, supporting piercers like Talented [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to protect your stack from the Wave Attacks, and you're good to go.

